{
  "name": "dsh-client-ui-sounds-control",
  "description": "DSH Web GUI 语音控制插件：对话「会话结束 / 弹出选项 / 请求许可 / 停止」时播放指定音效；可拖动悬浮球（靠边缩成半球）、可移动置顶配置弹窗；音效来自插件包 sounds/ 文件夹的本地音频；支持鲸鱼娘/纯白/纯黑三种外观；配置自动保存（浏览器 + 宿主 config.json 双持久化）；启动即预加载。Hot-pluggable — mounted via dsh plugin add + cordis.patch.yml, no dsh source changes.",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "sounds/README.txt",
    "sounds/hirari-do-demo.wav",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "web-ui",
    "audio",
    "sound",
    "voice-line",
    "angelina",
    "arknights"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
